					"content": "Jangan khawatir, harusnya si Pahsiv bisa berenang sih.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851903
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740851903,
					"content": "Iya sih ... Wuah! Lihat tuh pohon gedenya!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740851904,
					"content": "Cantik banget. Ternyata begini ya bentuk aslinya? Si Pahsiv pasti senang kalau bisa ngelihat pohonnya sekarang.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740851905,
					"content": "#Paimon! Pahsiv! {NICKNAME}! Pahsiv!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740851906,
					"content": "Pahsiv? Fuhh, untunglah. Kamu barusan ke mana ih? Kami khawatir loh.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740851907,
					"content": "Tanpa jejak, Pahsiv.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740851908,
					"content": "Wah! Kotak! Pahsiv!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851909
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740851909,
					"content": "Eh? Ini ... peti harta karun? Kamu pergi cari ya?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740851910,
					"content": "Pahsiv! Tapi, emas berkilauan, bulat, Melusine ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851911
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740851911,
					"content": "Mora-nya tidak ketemu? Enggak apa-apa kok! Bisa ketemu ini saja sudah lumayan!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740851912,
					"content": "Paimon tersentuh deh! Kamu benar-benar ingat kata-kata Paimon. Terima kasih!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851913
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740851913,
					"content": "Terima ... kasih?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851916
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740851916,
					"content": "Terima kasih itu artinya Pahsiv!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851917
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740851917,
					"content": "#Paimon, terima kasih! {NICKNAME}, terima kasih!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851918
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740851918,
					"content": "#Paimon, baik! {NICKNAME}, baik!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851919
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pahsiv"
				},
				{
					"id": 740851919,
					"content": "Pahsiv! Baik!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851920
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740851920,
					"content": "Pahsiv! Baik!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851921
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740851921,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}, kalau ada waktu luang, kita sering-sering main yuk sama si Pahsiv. Paimon mau ngajarin dia ucapan-ucapan lebih banyak lagi, sama kayak si tamu itu.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851922
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740851922,
					"content": "Pahsiv!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851923
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740851923,
					"content": "Pahsiv, gimana menurutmu? Oke enggak nih kami kalau nanti-nanti kita main bareng lagi?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851924
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740851924,
					"content": "Lah kok dia hilang lagi sih?!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851925
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740851925,
					"content": "Pahsiv, tanpa jejak?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851926
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740851926,
					"content": "Wow! Paimon belum pernah nih ngelihat Melusine yang kayak gini sebelumnya ... lebih tepatnya, dia bukan kayak Melusine, tapi malah kayak sesosok peri yang misterius.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851927
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740851927,
					"content": "Tapi mungkin karena ini juga jadinya dia bisa ngawasin si ungu nakal itu tanpa gangguan ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740851928
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740851928,
					"content": "Hei! Pahsiv! Dadah! Nanti lain kali, kami akan ngajarin kamu cara bilang selamat tinggal ya!",
